,"id":58704291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzA0Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58704291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels","html_url":"https://github.com/greenpixels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/greenpixels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T20:47:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:49:18Z","body":"This behavior has always rubbed me the wrong way.\nI'd expect the icon at minimum size to expand to the font size while keeping its aspect ratio, so that the icon never disappears. Why else would I set an icon for a button if not for it to be shown.\n\n\"Expand Icon\" should change the button size and not be dissipated by the text.\nJust setting a minimum size is not an answer if the game is localized and there are differing text lengths for a single button depending on locale, making the only option a custom HBoxContainer for every single IconButton, throwing away configuring it via the theme editor.\n\nAt the very least there should also be a \"icon_min_width\" for icons just as there is a \"icon_max_width\".","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6025156332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]